<title>NEW ZEALAND: NZ's FCL stocks will reflect fundamentals - Fletcher.</title>
<headline>NZ's FCL stocks will reflect fundamentals - Fletcher.</headline>
<dateline>AUCKLAND 1996-08-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Fletcher Challenge Group Chief Executive Hugh Fletcher said on Wednesday he was confident the company's &quot;letter&quot; stocks, which debuted in March, would begin to reflect fundamentals over time.</p>
<p>Fletcher told Reuters the company had always been of the view that the value of the letter stocks -- FCL Building, FCL Energy and FCL Paper -- had been not been recognised in the share price.</p>
</text>
